<h1>@Localizer["Engineering plastics: match the grade to the environment"]</h1>
<p class="docs-lead">@Localizer["Plastic selection involves more than replacing metal with a lighter shape. Time, temperature, moisture, and processing history can change dimensions and performance. Start with the function and the actual grade, then validate the finished part under representative conditions. The families below are candidates for discussion, not an availability list."]</p>
<figure class="docs-figure knowledge-photo">
    <img src="/src/images/knowledge/photos/engineering-plastics.webp" srcset="/src/images/knowledge/photos/engineering-plastics-small.webp 768w, /src/images/knowledge/photos/engineering-plastics.webp 1536w" sizes="(min-width: 72rem) calc(100vw - 25rem), calc(100vw - 4rem)" alt="@Localizer["A polymer gear, bushings, ring, seal, housing and transparent cover."]" width="1536" height="1024" loading="eager" decoding="async" fetchpriority="high" />
    <figcaption>@Localizer["Polymer choice must account for moisture, time under load, temperature and manufacturing route. Illustrative image."]</figcaption>
